  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the Development of Biogas Energy Amongst Select Small- and Medium-Sized Agro-Industries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Related to preparation phase ID 100179: The project aims to reduce GHG emissions by promoting investment and market development of biogas energy technologies in select agro-industries in Chile. This project was requested by the Renewable Energy Centre of Chile (CER) - now CIFES - to UNIDO through the GEF operational focal point at the Ministry of Environment of Chile as part of the Government of Chile&apos;s efforts to mitigate climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
